dia.com/stockinfo/AnnPdfOpen.aspx?Pname=BBF3467E_76BE_4E81_8EF7_B503C7CC288C_154740.pdf","source":"bse"},{"kind":"annual_report","date":"2016-03-31","title":"Financial Year 2016","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/bseplus/AnnualReport/526371/5263710316.pdf","source":"bse"},{"kind":"annual_report","date":"2015-03-31","title":"Financial Year 2015","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/bseplus/AnnualReport/526371/5263710315.pdf","source":"bse"},{"kind":"annual_report","date":"2014-03-31","title":"Financial Year 2014","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/bseplus/AnnualReport/526371/5263710314.pdf","source":"bse"},{"kind":"annual_report","date":"2013-03-31","title":"Financial Year 2013","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/bseplus/AnnualReport/526371/5263710313.pdf","source":"bse"},{"kind":"annual_report","date":"2012-03-31","title":"Financial Year 2012","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/bseplus/AnnualReport/526371/5263710312.pdf","source":"bse"},{"kind":"annual_report","date":"2011-03-31","title":"Financial Year 2011","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/bseplus/AnnualReport/526371/5263710311.pdf","source":"bse"}],"analysis":{"summary":"NMDC reported strong operational and financial performance for FY26, crossing 53 million tons in production and setting a foundation to achieve 100 million tons by the end of the decade. The company is expanding its portfolio into coal through the Tokisud and Rohne blocks and entering the critical minerals and rare earths sector via new subsidiaries and joint ventures. Management highlighted aggressive capital expenditure plans, projecting capex around INR6,000 crores to INR7,000 crores for the current year, and noted robust domestic iron ore demand alongside strategic initiatives like a Vizag blending yard. NMDC reported its financial and physical performance for the quarter and year ended March 31, 2026, highlighting production and sales figures along with profitability metrics. During the fourth quarter of FY26, iron ore production reached 162.72 lakh tonnes and sales stood at 152.99 lakh tonnes, with revenue from operations at Rs.","themes":{"guidance":[{"claim":"The company targets a production of 60 million tons for the financial year.","quote":"And in that journey, I think this year we will be targeting 60 million tons, which we hope to achieve.","doc_kind":"concall_transcript","doc_date":"2026-06-01","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/stockinfo/AnnPdfOpen.aspx?Pname=448ad212-4e58-4344-81a6-0325b40a9267.pdf"},{"claim":"Coal guidance for Tokisud is around 0.75 million ton to 1 million ton of coal for the year.","quote":"And our guidance for Q2 would be around 0.75 million ton to 1 million ton of coal this year.","doc_kind":"concall_transcript","doc_date":"2026-06-01","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/stockinfo/AnnPdfOpen.aspx?Pname=448ad212-4e58-4344-81a6-0325b40a9267.pdf"}],"demand_outlook":[{"claim":"Management stated that demand will not be an issue even for a 100 million ton production.","quote":"So I don't think demand would be ever a problem for NMDC, especially the quality of ore that we produce, simply because of the phosphorus, the low phosphorus that we have.","doc_kind":"concall_transcript","doc_date":"2026-06-01","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/stockinfo/AnnPdfOpen.aspx?Pname=448ad212-4e58-4344-81a6-0325b40a9267.pdf"},{"claim":"Steel prices and iron ore prices are currently in a period of price stability.","quote":"And then March it stabilized, March and April it has reasonably stabilized and I think we are in some period of price stability both in terms of steel and consequently in terms of iron ore as well.","doc_kind":"concall_transcript","doc_date":"2026-06-01","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/stockinfo/AnnPdfOpen.aspx?Pname=448ad212-4e58-4344-81a6-0325b40a9267.pdf"},{"claim":"NMDC reported an average domestic iron ore realization of Rs 4,992 per tonne for 9M FY26 compared to Rs 5,187 per tonne in 9M FY25.","quote":"Average DomesticRealization (Rs./T) 4,992 5,187 (195) (4%)","doc_kind":"concall_ppt","doc_date":"2026-02-01","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/stockinfo/AnnPdfOpen.aspx?Pname=de849b8f-f01c-4def-90c3-58b1001b4182.pdf"}],"capex_expansion":[{"claim":"The board sanctioned an investment proposal of approximately INR3,000 crores for a blending yard at Vizag.","quote":"The Board has sanctioned INR3,000 crores for the blending yard at Vizag and that will be our first output would be the, the branded iron ore from there, which I'm sure will fetch a substantial premium in the market because it increases blast furnace efficiency very substantially.","doc_kind":"concall_transcript","doc_date":"2026-06-01","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/stockinfo/AnnPdfOpen.aspx?Pname=448ad212-4e58-4344-81a6-0325b40a9267.pdf"},{"claim":"NMDC reported total investments of Rs 1,419.98 crore across its subsidiaries, joint ventures, and associates.","quote":"Total Investments - Rs. 1,419.98 crore","doc_kind":"concall_ppt","doc_date":"2026-02-01","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/stockinfo/AnnPdfOpen.aspx?Pname=de849b8f-f01c-4def-90c3-58b1001b4182.pdf"}],"margins_costs":[{"claim":"Operational expenses for 9M FY26 increased by 58% to Rs 6,278 crore compared to Rs 3,965 crore in 9M FY25.","quote":"Operational Expenses 6,278 3,965 2,313 58%","doc_kind":"concall_ppt","doc_date":"2026-02-01","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/stockinfo/AnnPdfOpen.aspx?Pname=de849b8f-f01c-4def-90c3-58b1001b4182.pdf"}],"orders_capacity":[{"claim":"Production surpassed expectations, crossing the figure of 50 million tons.","quote":"As CMD sahab has just mentioned, we have surpassed all the expectations and crossed the magical figure of the production which is 50 million tons.","doc_kind":"concall_transcript","doc_date":"2026-06-01","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/stockinfo/AnnPdfOpen.aspx?Pname=448ad212-4e58-4344-81a6-0325b40a9267.pdf"},{"claim":"The peak rated capacity of Deposit 4 is 7 million ton.","quote":"then it will be ramped up to 7 million ton, which is the peak rated capacity of Deposit 4.","doc_kind":"concall_transcript","doc_date":"2026-06-01","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/stockinfo/AnnPdfOpen.aspx?Pname=448ad212-4e58-4344-81a6-0325b40a9267.pdf"},{"claim":"Peak rated capacity of Tokisud is 2.3 million ton.","quote":"So it is the peak rated as you know in Tokisud is 2.3 million ton.","doc_kind":"concall_transcript","doc_date":"2026-06-01","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/stockinfo/AnnPdfOpen.aspx?Pname=448ad212-4e58-4344-81a6-0325b40a9267.pdf"},{"claim":"Iron ore production reached 368.86 lakh tonnes in 9M FY26, up 20% compared to 307.65 lakh tonnes in 9M FY25.","quote":"Iron Ore Production(LT) 368.86 307.65 61.21 20%","doc_kind":"concall_ppt","doc_date":"2026-02-01","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/stockinfo/AnnPdfOpen.aspx?Pname=de849b8f-f01c-4def-90c3-58b1001b4182.pdf"},{"claim":"Iron ore sales grew 10% year-on-year to 349.40 lakh tonnes in 9M FY26.","quote":"Iron Ore Sales (LT) 349.40 317.36 32.04 10%","doc_kind":"concall_ppt","doc_date":"2026-02-01","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/stockinfo/AnnPdfOpen.aspx?Pname=de849b8f-f01c-4def-90c3-58b1001b4182.pdf"}],"capital_allocation":[{"claim":"The company has no immediate plans of leveraging the balance sheet, aiming to service capex through internal resources.","quote":"As of now there are no immediate plans of leveraging our balance sheet. The current visibility is that we should be able to service all our capex and acquisition requirements through internal resources.","doc_kind":"concall_transcript","doc_date":"2026-06-01","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/stockinfo/AnnPdfOpen.aspx?Pname=448ad212-4e58-4344-81a6-0325b40a9267.pdf"},{"claim":"The company reported total investments in subsidiaries, joint ventures, and associates amounting to Rs. 1,419.98 crore.","quote":"Total Investments - Rs. 1,419.98 crore","doc_kind":"concall_ppt","doc_date":"2026-06-01","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/stockinfo/AnnPdfOpen.aspx?Pname=e1a5cc20-759d-47e0-a23a-e3971d700ec9.pdf"},{"claim":"NMDC earned interest income of Rs 553 crore from bank deposits in 9M FY26, down 29% from Rs 774 crore in 9M FY25.","quote":"Interest Income from Deposits with Banks 553 774 (221) (29%)","doc_kind":"concall_ppt","doc_date":"2026-02-01","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/stockinfo/AnnPdfOpen.aspx?Pname=de849b8f-f01c-4def-90c3-58b1001b4182.pdf"}],"risks_headwinds":[{"claim":"Export duty on iron ore is at 30%, making direct exports economically unviable.","quote":"With a 30% export duty, it doesn't make too much of a sense to do that. If you have to export, you should be exporting pellets.","doc_kind":"concall_transcript","doc_date":"2026-06-01","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/stockinfo/AnnPdfOpen.aspx?Pname=448ad212-4e58-4344-81a6-0325b40a9267.pdf"},{"claim":"The company noted that shifts in demand, competition, and technology could cause actual results to differ from expectations.","quote":"A multitude of factors including, but not limited to, changes in demand, competition and technology, can cause actual events, performance or results to differ significantly from any anticipated development.","doc_kind":"concall_ppt","doc_date":"2026-02-01","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/stockinfo/AnnPdfOpen.aspx?Pname=de849b8f-f01c-4def-90c3-58b1001b4182.pdf"}]},"management_commitments":[{"claim":"The company aims to reach 100 million tons of capacity by the end of the decade.","quote":"I believe that this sets the foundation for us to achieve 100 million tons by the end of this decade.","doc_kind":"concall_transcript","doc_date":"2026-06-01","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/stockinfo/AnnPdfOpen.aspx?Pname=448ad212-4e58-4344-81a6-0325b40a9267.pdf","timeframe":"by the end of this decade"},{"claim":"Commercial mining at Deposit 4 is expected to commence in July in Q2.","quote":"We hope to have commercial mining commencing on July, that's in Q2.","doc_kind":"concall_transcript","doc_date":"2026-06-01","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/stockinfo/AnnPdfOpen.aspx?Pname=448ad212-4e58-4344-81a6-0325b40a9267.pdf","timeframe":"Q2"},{"claim":"Commercial production from Rohne is planned to open around late Q3.","quote":"We plan to open it around late Q3. And this year we don't see, envisage any production out of Rohne because the overburden removal etcetera will have to be carried out once the mine is opened.","doc_kind":"concall_transcript","doc_date":"2026-06-01","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/stockinfo/AnnPdfOpen.aspx?Pname=448ad212-4e58-4344-81a6-0325b40a9267.pdf","timeframe":"late Q3"},{"claim":"The blending yard project at Vizag is expected to be completed in around 2 years to 2.5 years.","quote":"One board has already sanctioned INR3,000 crores, which I think will be completed in around 2 years' time, 2.5 years' time.","doc_kind":"concall_transcript","doc_date":"2026-06-01","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/stockinfo/AnnPdfOpen.aspx?Pname=448ad212-4e58-4344-81a6-0325b40a9267.pdf","timeframe":"2 years to 2.5 years"},{"claim":"Liquidating the entire amount of outstanding receivables from NSL is expected to take a year and a half to max two years.","quote":"I guess it should take about a year and a half, max two to liquidate all the entire amount of outstanding.","doc_kind":"concall_transcript","doc_date":"2026-06-01","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/stockinfo/AnnPdfOpen.aspx?Pname=448ad212-4e58-4344-81a6-0325b40a9267.pdf","timeframe":"1.5 to 2 years"},{"claim":"The final section of the railway line between Bhansi and Bacheli will get completed in the month of December.","quote":"One section is expected to be completed this month-end and one final section that is between Bhansi and Bacheli will get completed in the month of December because there are a couple of bridges that needs to be constructed there.","doc_kind":"concall_transcript","doc_date":"2026-06-01","url":"https://www.bseindia.com/stockinfo/AnnPdfOpen.aspx?Pname=448ad212-4e58-4344-81a6-0325b40a9267.pdf","timeframe":"December"}],"coverage":{"docs_analysed":3,"kinds":["concall_transcript","concall_ppt"]}},"_meta":{"model":"gemini-3.6-flash","grounded":true,"facts_kept":24,"facts_dropped_ungrounded":5,"note":"Facts are verbatim-grounded against the company's own documents; claims whose quote was not found were dropped."}}